      "GAIL: We are coming to you live from our nation’s capitol where the Barden University Bellas are about to rock the historic Kennedy Center.\nBECA: One, two, three, four...\nBECA: THEY SAY YOU'RE A FREAK WHEN WE'RE HAVING FUN...",
