      "GAIL: Lots of us!\nFAT AMY: ...I CAME IN LIKE A WRECKING BALL!\nFAT AMY: DON'T YOU EVER SAY I JUST WALKED AWAY/I WILL ALWAYS WANT YOU...\nBECA: Goodbye innocence.",
